#: includes/queries/class-not-found-query.php:51
msgid "Requested URLs that returned a 404 Not Found error, for a date range, from Independent Analytics: one row per requested path (not_found_url) with views, visitors and sessions. Shows broken links and pages visitors expect to exist, which may need a redirect or new content. Query strings and fragments are removed from these URLs, so two rows can share a path when Independent Analytics recorded them with different query strings. Paged."
msgstr "Requested URLs that returned a 404 Not Found error, for a date range, from Independent Analytics: one row per requested path (not_found_url) with views, visitors and sessions. Shows broken links and pages visitors expect to exist, which may need a redirect or new content. Query strings and fragments are removed from these URLs, so two rows can share a path when Independent Analytics recorded them with different query strings. Paged."
